{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00829",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.14,
      "end_seconds": 15.87,
      "duration_seconds": 13.73,
      "text": "Hello. Um, I'm back about the pain in my chest, when I breathe. I had that chest infection last month, and the pain didn't go with it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.72,
      "end_seconds": 23.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Tell me about the pain. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.24,
      "end_seconds": 35.39,
      "duration_seconds": 10.15,
      "text": "On the right, low down, at the side. Sharp. It catches when I take a deep breath, or cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.01,
      "end_seconds": 42.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.95,
      "end_seconds": 55.46,
      "duration_seconds": 9.51,
      "text": "Three weeks. It was worse at first, and it's a bit better now, but it's still there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.04,
      "end_seconds": 62.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Any fever, or coughing up phlegm? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.35,
      "end_seconds": 70.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "No fever, and the cough's much less. It's dry."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.86,
      "end_seconds": 76.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Any breathlessness? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.77,
      "end_seconds": 85.94,
      "duration_seconds": 7.17,
      "text": "A little, on the stairs. It's not as bad as before. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.45,
      "end_seconds": 92.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.4,
      "end_seconds": 101.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "Ibuprofen, 400 mg, three times a day. For the pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.6,
      "end_seconds": 107.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.55,
      "end_seconds": 112.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.39,
      "end_seconds": 118.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Any history of lung problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.75,
      "end_seconds": 122.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Asthma, mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.09,
      "end_seconds": 130.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Let me check your numbers. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.29,
      "end_seconds": 134.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Go on. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.46,
      "end_seconds": 157.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "Pulse 74, blood pressure 128 over 80, temperature 36.6, oxygen 97 percent, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.53,
      "end_seconds": 162.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Fine? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.62,
      "end_seconds": 187.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Fine. Let me listen. Breathe in and out, deep."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.37,
      "end_seconds": 191.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.39,
      "end_seconds": 205.24,
      "duration_seconds": 10.85,
      "text": "There's a scratchy sound, a friction rub, at the right base when you breathe in, and the rest of your chest is clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.98,
      "end_seconds": 210.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "What is it? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.8,
      "end_seconds": 227.99,
      "duration_seconds": 14.19,
      "text": "Together with your history, a recent chest infection, and now sharp pain with breathing, that sound is classic for pleurisy, inflammation of the lining of the lung, after the infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.72,
      "end_seconds": 234.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Is it dangerous? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.45,
      "end_seconds": 248.83,
      "duration_seconds": 12.38,
      "text": "Usually it settles by itself. But because it's lasted three weeks, I'd like a chest X-ray, to check there's no fluid or anything else."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.08,
      "end_seconds": 253.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "When? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.55,
      "end_seconds": 267.39,
      "duration_seconds": 9.84,
      "text": "This week. Carry on with the ibuprofen, but take it with food, and not more than the label says."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.83,
      "end_seconds": 271.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.02,
      "end_seconds": 282.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "Rest when you need to, and don't push exercise until the pain has settled. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.96,
      "end_seconds": 287.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.77,
      "end_seconds": 300.54,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "If the pain gets worse, you become breathless at rest, cough up blood, or get a fever, come back that day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.11,
      "end_seconds": 306.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I will. Thank you. ~"
    }
  ]
}
